{"type":"npc","name":"Arahabaki (Icon Angel)","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":300,"temp":0,"max":300,"details":""},"ac":{"value":37,"details":"(33 when broken), pottery armor"},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to all saves vs. magic"},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":20},{"type":"fly","value":30}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"doomed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"drained","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fatigued","exceptions":[]},{"type":"nonlethal-attacks","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sickened","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"unholy","value":15,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"void","value":15,"exceptions":[]}],"hardness":{"value":null}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","diabolic","draconic","empyrean","jyoti","petran"],"details":"Speak with animals, Speak with plants, Truespeech"},"level":{"value":15},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When early mortals abandoned the ancient spirits they worshiped in favor of newer gods, some neglected spirits turned to despair and twisted into fiends. Others ascended to the celestial planes, sharing their wisdom with the benevolent young gods. As these ascended spirits shared their knowledge, they felt their essence being absorbed by the celestial planes and asked to be bound into physical forms so they could return to assist mortalkind. Angels sculpted pottery bodies out of clay and invited the spirits to inhabit them, turning them into true angels: the arahabaki.</p><p>Loving and kind to the extreme, arahabakis adore mortals. They relentlessly roam, seeking out communities in need and purging them of corruption. In addition to intervening in times of crisis, arahabakis provide guidance and mentorship. Arahabakis tries to avoid exposing people to fights they aren't strong enough to win, so when truly cataclysmic threats arise, they send calls for aid out to great heroes from far and wide.</p><h2>March of Ages</h2><p>Arahabakis sometimes enter periods of extended hibernation, during which they appear as lifeless (though beautiful and unaging) statues. In this state, an arahabaki maintains awareness of their surroundings, yet their perception of time slows down to a near-halt. In the mortal lifetimes that might pass before the arahabaki reawakens, their purpose can lose meaning or be forgotten by the societies they once protected. This sometimes puts them at odds with adventurers seeking to explore the ancient ruins the arahabaki guards or learn some secret the arahabaki believes would do more harm than good if rediscovered.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 810/1,850/3,400 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Crafting, Diplomacy, Medicine, Nature, Religion, Society, Survival)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, charisma, constitution, earth, earth armor, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), holy, life, lifeward armor, light, mirrored, sensory (darkvision), spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-spells.QiTHjk7DMecYFlrS]{Boulder Crush}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Hnc7eGi7vyZenAIm]{Breath of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.x5rGOmhDRDVQPrnW]{Field of Life}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.rfZpqmj0AIIdkVIs]{Heal}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4]{Light}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.2Vkd1IxylPceUAAF]{Regenerate}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.8xRzLhwGL7Dgy3EZ]{Sanctuary}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.BBvV7qoXGdw09q1C]{Speak with Animals}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.qvwIwJ9QBihy8R0t]{Speak with Plants}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.SnjhtQYexDtNDdEg]{Stabilize}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.SwUiVavHKMWG7t5K]{Truespeech}), spirit, strength, sturdy, tangle shield, throwing, wild, winged, wisdom, wood</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Benjamin Tait","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":6},"cha":{"mod":8}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":27,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":26,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":28,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":27},"crafting":{"base":25},"diplomacy":{"base":29},"medicine":{"base":29},"nature":{"base":27},"religion":{"base":25},"society":{"base":27},"survival":{"base":27}},"traits":{"value":["angel","celestial","holy"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"_id":"AWNYprN4tWMiriAu","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/arahabaki.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Arahabaki","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/arahabaki.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/arahabaki.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Pottery Armor (Hardness 15)","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>Each arahabaki is encased in pottery armor. Like normal objects, the pottery armor has Hardness. This Hardness reduces any damage the arahabaki takes by an amount equal to the Hardness. Once an arahabaki is reduced to less than half their maximum Hit Points, or immediately upon being damaged by a critical hit, their pottery armor breaks, they lose their immunities, and their Armor Class is reduced to 33. While the armor is broken, the radius of their healing aura decreases to 15 feet and their fly speed increases to 60 feet. The arahabaki can repair or reconstruct their pottery armor with 10 minutes of meditation.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.NPCAbility.ConstructArmor.CriticalHit","option":"construct-armor","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"selector":"ac","value":-4},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hardness.value","phase":"afterDerived","predicate":[{"nor":["construct-armor",{"lte":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"value":15,"priority":51},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"flags.sf2e.healingAura","predicate":[{"nor":["construct-armor",{"lte":["hp-percent",50]}]}],"value":15},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"fly-speed","value":30,"predicate":[{"or":["construct-armor",{"lt":["hp-percent",50]}]}]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"deathNote":false},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","duplicateSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.pathfinder-monster-core.Actor.CFlx1tkRxKC9qAC7.Item.GhnXpFtWM1vyvu8V","exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.348","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.3"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"GdFs4UrHjqTmw0JE"},{"type":"action","name":"Healing Aura","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>30 feet. All allied creatures in the aura gain fast healing 5 and a +2 status bonus to all saves against poison and disease for as long as they remain in the aura. After any creature afflicted by a condition spends at least 1 minute within the aura, the aura attempts a counteract check against all afflictions affecting it with a [[/r 1d20+28 #Counteract]]{+28} modifier, as an 8th-rank @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0]. The aura can't attempt another counteract check against the same case of the affliction for 24 hours.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","traits":["divine","vitality"],"effects":[{"uuid":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.sf2e-effects.Item.soHWMSWC6NJ6QYvA","affects":"allies","includesSelf":false}],"radius":"@actor.flags.sf2e.healingAura"},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"flags.sf2e.healingAura","value":30}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["aura","divine","vitality"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"HtpRqprJN8mWJf2t